{"id":"b69b13179ecbdd3e","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability.md","title":"双向证明翻译的充分条件","display":"prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability — 双向证明翻译的充分条件","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability","aliases":["91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability","91-prop-theory-translation","91-prop-intertranslatable"],"display":"prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability — 双向证明翻译的充分条件","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-strength]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability</span><span>91-prop-theory-translation</span><span>91-prop-intertranslatable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-theory-intertranslatability — 双向证明翻译的充分条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2\">\\(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2\\)</span> (两个形式理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{12}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\\to\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\">\\(\\tau_{12}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\\to\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{21}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\to\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\">\\(\\tau_{21}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\to\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\\)</span>\n(保持逻辑结构与自由变量的可计算翻译)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_1}\n(\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\\sigma\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal T_2\\vdash\\tau_{12}(\\sigma))\">\\(\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_1}\n(\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\\sigma\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal T_2\\vdash\\tau_{12}(\\sigma))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\\)</span> 对称定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\n[\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\n\\tau_{21}(\\tau_{12}(\\varphi))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi]\">\\(\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\n[\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\n\\tau_{21}(\\tau_{12}(\\varphi))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi]\\)</span>；\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\\)</span> 对称定义</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\\land\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\n\\land\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\\land\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\">\\(\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\\land\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\n\\land\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\\land\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{12}),\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{21})\">\\(\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{12}),\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{21})\\)</span>\n(翻译由对方语言中的显式定义给出)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefEq}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\">\\(\\operatorname{DefEq}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\\)</span> (定义等价)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}intertranslatability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}\n(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}intertranslatability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}\n(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>进一步，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\n\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{12})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{21})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{DefEq}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\n\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{12})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{21})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{DefEq}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仅有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathcal T_2\\vdash\\tau_{12}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathcal T_2\\vdash\\tau_{12}(\\varphi)\\)</span>\n的单向保持还不够；翻译必须兼容\n逻辑构造，并且往返翻译在相应理论中恢复原公式，才能得到这里定义的\n双向可逆翻译。要进一步称为定义等价，还必须验证两向翻译确由显式定义\n给出；单纯的可计算互译或互可解释性都不够。</p>\n<p>标准 KF 与 VF 的算术证明论强度不同：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span>。因此它们不满足这里的\n定义等价结论；共同使用固定点思想并不提供双向逆翻译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{12}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\\to\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{21}:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_2}\\to\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_1}\n(\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\\sigma\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal T_2\\vdash\\tau_{12}(\\sigma))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_1}\n[\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\n\\tau_{21}(\\tau_{12}(\\varphi))\\leftrightarrow\\varphi]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\\land\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\n\\land\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\\land\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{12}),\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{21})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefEq}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}intertranslatability}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{12}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Pres}_{21}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{1}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Inv}_{2}\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}\n(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left[\n\\operatorname{BiTrans}_{\\tau_{12},\\tau_{21}}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{12})\n\\land\n\\operatorname{DefTrans}(\\tau_{21})\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{DefEq}(\\mathcal T_1,\\mathcal T_2).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_1\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathcal T_2\\vdash\\tau_{12}(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false}],"bytes":2799,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["c87db4d1858a0009","a0a2284f96eaea1d","669ee474b9646a38"]}